 "content_notes": "Tone: absurd and ironic; nobody is mocked. No weapon and no violence are shown; the only tools are a torch, a drill-sized hole and a plain rod. Every thief (Copenhagen, Taillevent, the catacombs: all unidentified, no arrests reported) is drawn ONLY as a dark rim-lit silhouette tagged NOT A LIKENESS and never named. Formel B and Les Caves de Taillevent are named only as plain text: every bottle is a generic dark bottle with a blank cream label; no logo, sign, label artwork or real building is imitated. The catacomb skulls are small stylised shapes in wall niches (the ossuary), never remains of a victim, no gore. The cellar owner is not named, described or drawn. Every card is our own typed graphic. No dialogue or quotation (the police line is a paraphrase). Facts verified 2026-10-18.",
